#: ../../source/involved/style_guide.rst:70
msgid "**Text Formatting**"
msgstr "**Форматирование текста**"

#: ../../source/involved/style_guide.rst:72
msgid ""
"Element           Formatting              Example ----------------- "
"----------------------- ------------------------ Class names       "
"``monospace``           ``Camera`` Method names      ``monospace()``"
"         ``setFov()`` Properties        **bold**                "
"**enabled** File names        ``monospace``           ``main.cpp`` Paths"
"             ``monospace``           ``/resources/textures/`` Code"
"              .. code-block::         with language specified Values"
"            ``monospace``           ``true``, ``nullptr``"
msgstr ""
"Элемент               Форматирование            Пример\n"
"--------------------- ------------------------ ------------------------\n"
"Имена классов         ``monospace``             ``Camera``\n"
"Имена методов         ``monospace()``           ``setFov()``\n"
"Свойства              **жирный**                **enabled**\n"
"Имена файлов          ``monospace``             ``main.cpp``\n"
"Пути                  ``monospace``             ``/resources/textures/``\n"
"Код                   .. code-block::           с указанием языка\n"
"Значения              ``monospace``             ``true``, ``nullptr``"

